Sustainability
Scope & Core Inquiries: In terms of its operations, products, and supply chains, to what extent does this company preserve the climate, biosphere, and natural resources? Does it engage in greenwashing—making unverified "net-zero" promises, misleading eco-labeling, or purchasing dubious carbon offsets while expanding carbon-intensive activities? What are its audited greenhouse gas emissions across Scope 1 (direct operations), Scope 2 (purchased energy), and Scope 3 (full value chain and product lifecycle)? How responsibly does it address resource extraction, water depletion in arid regions, deforestation, biodiversity loss, single-use plastic packaging, and toxic electronic waste?